                    "textContent": "\n\n#Taskstocompletequarter2:\nThesearetheassignmentsorprojectsthatallstudentsarerequiredto\ncomplete:\nStep:1\nBasictaskHACKATHONMilestone-BasedInteractiveResume\nBuilderisamusttocomplete.WithoutthisHACKATHONQuarter2\nwillnotbeconsidereddone.\n\nFirst,updatetheresumebuilderHackathon.Dothisbeforeanything\nelse.\n\nImprovetheuserinterfaceofyourresumestomakethemlookbetter.\nHACKATHONLINK:https://github.com/panaverse/learn-\nnextjs/tree/main/HACKATHONS/-01.hackathon_minus_one\nSUBMISSIONFORMLINK:\nhttps://forms.gle/qa1dLhecmWvX3PpJ6\nStep:2\n\nNow,herearesomeHTMLandCSSassignmentsin2steps..\nLINK:https://github.com/Ameen-Alam/PIAIC-HTML-CSS-\nAssignments/\n\nThisHTMLandCSSassignmentisessentialforthosewhodon'tknow\nHTMLandCSSorwhosefoundationinHTMLandCSSisnotstrong.\nIfyoualreadyknowHTMLandCSS,youcanskipthis.Instead,submit\nalinktoanHTMLandCSSprojectyou’vecreatedfromscratch.\n\nInthelinkprovidedaboveinthisAssignment1to8itsjustHTML.\nAssignment8isHTML'sfinalAssignment.\nFromAssignment9to11ithasHTML&CSSboth.\n\nInAssignment12.WeneedtomakeacloneoftheJPG/PDFFile\nProvided.Onlyexceptioniswecanuseourownimageswhichareused\nhereonthiswebsiteifwewant.Nolibraryshallbeusedinthis.ONLY\nHTML&CSSALLOWED.Wecanmakethisforourself-assessment.\nIt’smandatorytocomplete12assignmentsifyouhaven’tcreatedany\nwebsitefromscratchusingHTMLandCSS.Youcansubmitthelinkof\n12assignments.\nStep:3\n\nNext.js&ReactMilestone\nLINK:https://docs.google.com/document/d/12Z7GxXtic5GD-\nvV3IjxornLuwYoCTVF1eYaQ2IdBdfI/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.54qaq1i58\nzev\n\nThisdocumenthas5Milestones.\n-Milestone5:CapstoneProject.OnlyuponcompletingtheMilestone5\nthefinalprojectofquarter2wewillbeeligibleforquarter3.\n\nForMilestone1wejustneedtosubmitcompletedornotcompletedinthe\nSubmissionformlink.NoGitHubrepositoryrequired.\nMILESTONE2:\n\nThismilestoneincludes2assignmentsand2projects.\n\nASSIGNMENTDETAILS:\n1.CreateMulti-pagewebsiteusingReactComponents&CustomCSS.\n2.Createamulti-pagewebsiteusingthesameReactcomponents,but\ninsteadofcustomstyling,useTailwindCSSforstyling.\n\nPROJECTSDETAILS:\n1.DevelopapersonalportfoliowebsiteusingCSSforstyling.Ensureto\nincludesectionslikeAboutMe,Projects,Skills,andContact.Submit\ntheGitHubrepositorylinkanddeploymentlinkforthisversion.\n2.RecreatethesamepersonalportfoliowebsiteusingTailwindCSSfor\nstyling.MaintainthesamesectionsasintheCSSversion.Submitthe\nGitHubrepositorylinkanddeploymentlinkforthisversion.\nBLOG/ARTICLEONNEXT.JS:\n\nCompleteMilestone2andbreakhere.Afterthat,workonthetask\nassignedbySirAmeentocreateablog/articleonNext.js.Once\nthat'sfinished,youcantransitiontoMilestone3.\nMILESTONE3:\nThismilestoneincludes1assignmentsand1projects.\nASSIGNMENT:Createadynamicblogwithmultiplepostsusing\nNext.jsroutingandimplementacommentssectionthatutilizesReact\nstateformanagingcomments.\nPROJECT:Developabasice-commercesitefeaturingproductdetails,\nashoppingcart,andproductmanagementusinganAPIkeytomanage\nproductdata.EnsuretoprovidetheGitHubrepositorylinkand\ndeploymentlinkforsubmission.\nMILESTONE4:\nASSIGNMENT:FetchanddisplaydatafromapublicAPIusing\nbothServer-SideRendering(SSR)andStaticSiteGeneration(SSG),\nandimplementbasicuserauthenticationusingasimpleauthentication\nAPI.\n\nPROJECT:(Thisisadvancelevelanditwilltaketimeto\nreachuptothislevel)Buildafully-functionalblogplatform.\nForthisGitHubrepository&DeploymentLinkisrequired.\nSUBMIISIOMFORMOFALLTASK:\nhttps://forms.gle/vqEsQPaW8btsvnTC7\n#Note:Thosewhoarewillingtocomplete4milestonesofnextjswithinamonthwillbe\nnominatedtomoveinthequarter3.\n#ThisisadetailedlistofassignmentsandprojectsthathavebeenprovidedbySirAmeen,whichare\nmandatoryforallstudentstocomplete.ThisPDFisnotanofficialdocument;Ithasbeencreatedto\nhelpstudentswhomaybefacingdifficulties,ensuringthatanyproblemstheyencounterareclarified.\nSTUDENTLEADER:ALEEMAKHAN\nSIR:SIRMUHAMMADBILAL&SIRALIAFTABSHEIKH\nSLOUT:Saturday(2to5)\n\n"
