            {
                "_id": "6739b589c9673c03de21630c",
                "filename": "Typescript HTECH online course (1) (1).pdf",
                "fileType": "application/pdf",
                "fileSize": 474778,
                "metadata": {
                    "textContent": "\n\nHTECH ONLINE CODING COURSE | HOME TUTORS WORLD \n \nHOME TUTORS WORLD \n \nONLINE COURSE \nTypeScript Coding Course  \nGoals and Objectives: \n Goal: Introduce Students to TypeScript programming language for Web Applications. \n Objectives: \n1. Understand basic programming concepts using TypeScript. \n2. Develop problem-solving skills through coding exercises. \n3. Create interactive projects using TypeScript. \n4. Foster a love for coding and technology. \nCourse Content: \n1. Introduction to TypeScript \no Overview of TypeScript \no Setting up development environment \n2. Basic TypeScript Concepts \no Variables and Data Types \no Functions and Loops \no Conditionals and Control Flow \n3. Intermediate TypeScript \no Arrays and Objects \no Classes and Interfaces \no Modules and Namespaces \n4. Advanced TypeScript \no Object Oriented Programming \no Asynchronous Programming (Promises, Async/Await) \nWeekly Tasks: \n Week 1-4: Basics of TypeScript and programming fundamentals. \n Week 5-8: Intermediate concepts and project-based learning. \n Week 9-12: Advanced topics and building complex applications. \n Week 13-16: Final project development and presentations. \n\nHTECH ONLINE CODING COURSE | HOME TUTORS WORLD \n \nAssessment: \n Weekly Quizzes: Assess understanding of concepts covered. \n Coding Challenges: Hands-on exercises to apply learned concepts. \n Project Milestones: Regular check-ins on project progress. \nFinal Project: \n Objective: Develop a unique TypeScript application. \n Requirements: Incorporate multiple concepts learned throughout the course. \n Presentation: Demonstration and explanation of the final project. \nThis outline provides a framework to ensure comprehensive coverage of TypeScript while \nkeeping the sessions engaging and productive for the kids. Adjust the depth of topics based on \nthe age group and prior experience of the students. \n \n "
                },
                "s3Url": "https://hamza-aws.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/1731835272091-Typescript HTECH online course (1) (1).pdf",
                "uploadDate": "2024-11-17T09:21:13.796Z",
                "createdAt": "2024-11-17T09:21:13.798Z",
                "updatedAt": "2024-11-17T09:21:13.798Z",
                "__v": 0
